  "question": {
    "text": "A die is tossed 5 times. Getting an odd number is considered a success. Then the variance of distribution of success is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "\n8/3\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n3/8\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n4/5\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n5/4",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "The event follows binomial distribution with n = 5, p = 3/6 = 1/2\n$q=1-p=1 / 2 \\quad \\therefore$ Variance $n p q=5 / 4$"
  }
}